What:		/sys/kernel/kprofiles/kp_mode
Date:		October 2026
Contact:	ShadowBladeX maintainers
Description:
		Manual-only adaptation of beakthoven/Kprofiles. Read/write an
		integer: 0 Default (unchanged tuning), 1 Battery, 2 Balanced,
		3 Performance. Invalid writes preserve the previous mode.
		No display automation, temporary overrides or notifier API.
		Default is 0. Consumers define effects; see input boost drivers.
